1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:02,231
The secret to a
terrifying wizard

2
00:00:02,251 --> 00:00:04,351
isn't making them
unbeatable.

3
00:00:04,371 --> 00:00:05,589
Meet the Unmaker.

4
00:00:05,609 --> 00:00:08,120
Anything she can see,
she can erase.

5
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:09,984
But only what she
can see.

6
00:00:10,263 --> 00:00:11,668
So the heroes stop
fighting,

7
00:00:11,688 --> 00:00:13,063
and start thinking.

8
00:00:13,083 --> 00:00:13,451
Smoke.

9
00:00:13,471 --> 00:00:13,988
Fog.

10
00:00:14,008 --> 00:00:14,676
A wall.

11
00:00:14,696 --> 00:00:16,832
Every shadow becomes
a path.

12
00:00:16,852 --> 00:00:18,362
And she has to plan
too:

13
00:00:18,382 --> 00:00:19,575
mirrors,
lanterns,

14
00:00:19,595 --> 00:00:21,118
a higher tower.

15
00:00:21,138 --> 00:00:22,615
Unbeatable is boring.

16
00:00:22,635 --> 00:00:25,252
A weakness turns a
fight into a puzzle.

17
00:00:25,272 --> 00:00:27,042
Follow for more ways
to make fictional

18
00:00:27,062 --> 00:00:28,717
powers interesting.
